> **Deprecated.** Use `#add(long, long)` instead.

Adds two numbers.

**Parameters:**
- `a` — the first number
- `T` — the type of the numbers

**Returns:** the sum

**Throws:**
- `ArithmeticException` — if the sum overflows
- `IllegalStateException` — if it is not

**See Also:**
- #add(long, long)
- [the manual](https://example.com)

**Since:** 1.2
